%% VoxFlow — data lifecycle (deployment-dependent)
flowchart LR
    subgraph Host["Application host"]
        Audio[Call audio buffer]
        Transcript[Transcript turns]
        Audit[Tool + confirmation audit events]
        Snap[Session snapshots]
        DB[(Postgres<br/>calls, transcripts, escalations)]
    end
    subgraph Providers["Third-party providers"]
        STT[STT provider]
        LLM[LLM provider]
        TTS[TTS provider]
        Sheet[Google Sheets]
        Telemetry[Error / product telemetry]
    end
    Audio --> STT --> Transcript --> LLM --> TTS
    Transcript --> DB
    Audit --> DB
    Snap --> DB
    DB -->|mirror, tenant allow-list| Sheet
    DB --> Telemetry
    Audio -.->|retention setting| Purge[Retention purge]
    DB -.-> Purge
